      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "Five-line stave against time: bar numbers, category note heads, tie, playhead and tempo marking.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-stave\"><p class=\"ds-tempo\">Allegro <span>158 wpm</span></p><svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 110\" width=\"100%\"><g class=\"ds-st-l\"><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"30\"/><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"48\" y2=\"48\"/><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"66\" y2=\"66\"/><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"84\" y2=\"84\"/><line x1=\"0\" x2=\"320\" y1=\"102\" y2=\"102\"/><line x1=\"1\" x2=\"1\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"102\"/><line x1=\"107\" x2=\"107\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"102\"/><line x1=\"213\" x2=\"213\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"102\"/></g><line x1=\"318\" x2=\"318\" y1=\"30\" y2=\"102\" class=\"ds-st-end\"/><text x=\"2\" y=\"12\" class=\"ds-st-n\">0:00</text><text x=\"108\" y=\"12\" class=\"ds-st-n\">0:10</text><text x=\"214\" y=\"12\" class=\"ds-st-n\">0:20</text><rect x=\"140\" y=\"38\" width=\"60\" height=\"3\" rx=\"1.5\" class=\"ds-tie\"/><ellipse cx=\"140\" cy=\"39\" rx=\"4.4\" ry=\"3.1\" transform=\"rotate(-22 140 39)\" class=\"ds-h-sky\"/><ellipse cx=\"60\" cy=\"48\" rx=\"4.4\" ry=\"3.1\" transform=\"rotate(-22 60 48)\" class=\"ds-h-amber ds-open\"/><ellipse cx=\"250\" cy=\"30\" rx=\"4.4\" ry=\"3.1\" transform=\"rotate(-22 250 30)\" class=\"ds-h-violet\"/><line x1=\"170\" x2=\"170\" y1=\"24\" y2=\"110\" class=\"ds-play\"/></svg></div>",
      "css": ".ds-stave{border:1px solid oklch(0.91 0.014 256);border-radius:10px;background:#fff;padding:16px;font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif}.ds-tempo{margin:0 0 4px;font:italic 700 1.125rem/1.75rem 'Iowan Old Style',Charter,Palatino,Georgia,serif;color:oklch(0.27 0.032 263)}.ds-tempo span{font:400 .75rem ui-sans-serif,system-ui,sans-serif;color:oklch(0.55 0.025 259);margin-inline-start:8px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-st-l line{stroke:oklch(0.84 0.018 257);stroke-width:1}.ds-st-end{stroke:oklch(0.55 0.025 259);stroke-width:3}.ds-st-n{font:10px ui-monospace,Menlo,monospace;fill:oklch(0.68 0.022 258)}.ds-tie{fill:oklch(58.8% 0.158 241.966);opacity:.35}.ds-h-sky{fill:oklch(58.8% 0.158 241.966);stroke:oklch(58.8% 0.158 241.966);stroke-width:1.6;cursor:pointer}.ds-h-amber{stroke:oklch(66.6% 0.179 58.318);stroke-width:1.6}.ds-h-violet{fill:oklch(54.1% 0.281 293.009);stroke:oklch(54.1% 0.281 293.009);stroke-width:1.6}.ds-open{fill:none}.ds-play{stroke:oklch(0.5 0.19 264);stroke-width:2;stroke-linecap:round}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Weekly Measure",
      "kind": "custom",
      "description": "One measure per week; done beats are ink, met goals turn every done head brass.",
      "html": "<svg class=\"ds-measure\" viewBox=\"0 0 140 48\" width=\"140\" height=\"48\"><g class=\"ds-m-l\"><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"138\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"8\"/><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"138\" y1=\"16\" y2=\"16\"/><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"138\" y1=\"24\" y2=\"24\"/><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"138\" y1=\"32\" y2=\"32\"/><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"138\" y1=\"40\" y2=\"40\"/><line x1=\"2\" x2=\"2\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"40\"/><line x1=\"135\" x2=\"135\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"40\"/></g><line x1=\"138\" x2=\"138\" y1=\"8\" y2=\"40\" class=\"ds-m-end\"/><ellipse cx=\"24\" cy=\"24\" rx=\"6.5\" ry=\"4.6\" transform=\"rotate(-22 24 24)\" class=\"ds-m-won\"/><ellipse cx=\"50\" cy=\"24\" rx=\"6.5\" ry=\"4.6\" transform=\"rotate(-22 50 24)\" class=\"ds-m-won\"/><ellipse cx=\"76\" cy=\"24\" rx=\"6.5\" ry=\"4.6\" transform=\"rotate(-22 76 24)\" class=\"ds-m-won\"/><ellipse cx=\"102\" cy=\"24\" rx=\"6.5\" ry=\"4.6\" transform=\"rotate(-22 102 24)\" class=\"ds-m-won\"/></svg>",
      "css": ".ds-m-l line{stroke:oklch(0.84 0.018 257);stroke-width:1}.ds-m-end{stroke:oklch(0.55 0.025 259);stroke-width:2.5}.ds-m-won{fill:oklch(0.8 0.14 80);stroke:oklch(0.72 0.15 72);stroke-width:1.8}"
